('0a35e935-912a-4507-a17f-b636e684998e', 'Inclusions and Design - UV resin jewellery', 'workshop'::event_type, 'Discover the creative potential of UV resin jewellery in this inspiring practical course. Explore how natural and decorative inclusions such as shells, sea glass, dried flowers, feathers, and fine sand can be used to create unique, eye-catching designs. You will learn how to work confidently with UV resin while experimenting with layering, composition, and placement techniques to add depth, balance, and visual interest to your pieces. Drawing inspiration from a chosen theme, such as nature or th', '{}'::text[], array['drawing']::text[], array['community','hands-on','independent']::text[], 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/media/cache/7a/26/7a263883111fc8b41e0a59bc0f3030b7.jpg', '2026-11-03', '2026-12-01', '19:00:00', null, 'Adult Learning Lewisham', 'Adult Learning Lewisham, Brockley Rise Centre, 2 Brockley Rise, SE23 1PR', 'SE23 1PR', 'Lewisham', 51.46543, -0.01021, 'unknown'::price_type, null, true, 'https://all.org.uk/courses/jewellery/#course-89231', 'We Are Lewisham', 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/events/inclusionsanddesignuvresinjewellery/', '2026-11-14T11:48:39.377Z', 0.75, 'inclusions and design uv resin jewellery|adult learning lewisham|2026-11-03'),
