('9382479e-34b8-4a38-a491-2de32ebb8f0b', 'Make a contemporary and sustainable festive door wreath', 'workshop'::event_type, 'Create a stunning & fully sustainable natural style wreath to hang either inside your home or to decorate your front door. This would also make an impressive gift, and could be completely preserved and dried to re-use. To make your wreath fully biodegradable, you will construct the base using twigs and twine, and decorate it using a range of mixed seasonal foliage & dried and preserved materials. The focus of this style is to create a soft and highly textured design in subtle & natural colour to', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], array['community','christmas','hands-on','outdoor','independent']::text[], 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/media/cache/9d/a8/9da8c03123bcd54a2f51de99a5a5c0d3.jpg', '2026-11-30', null, '18:00:00', '21:30:00', 'Adult Learning Lewisham Granville Park Centre', 'Adult Learning Lewisham Granville Park Centre, 100 Granville Park, SE13 7DU', 'SE13 7DU', 'Lewisham', 51.46543, -0.01021, 'unknown'::price_type, null, true, 'https://all.org.uk/courses/floristry-practical-and-employability-skills/#course-88393', 'We Are Lewisham', 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/events/makeacontemporaryandsustainablefestivedoorwreath/', '2026-11-14T11:48:40.149Z', 0.75, 'make a contemporary and sustainable festive door wreath|adult learning lewisham granville park centre|2026-11-30'),
