('3ff6adb7-33ab-40a9-a0b9-b3465cef465e', 'A Christmas Carol', 'other'::event_type, 'A Christmas Carol by Charles Dickens adapted by Geoffrey Simon Brown presented by the Jack Studio Theatre Christmas Eve, 1843. Marley is as dead as a doornail. But for Scrooge, the night is far from over… When the clock strikes one Ebenezer embarks on a transformative journey as three mysterious spirits guide him through his past, present, and possible future – revealing the enduring power of compassion, generosity and second chances. A Christmas Carol is back at the Jack! Come and join us for t', '{}'::text[], array['performance']::text[], array['community','shows theatre','visual arts','christmas','late','independent']::text[], 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/media/cache/64/ad/64adda814e12aaa092f51fb41a491afb.png', '2026-12-08', '2026-12-30', '19:30:00', null, 'The Jack Studio Theatre', 'The Jack Studio Theatre, 410 Brockley Road, SE4 2DH', 'SE4 2DH', 'Lewisham', 51.454216, -0.037672, 'unknown'::price_type, null, true, 'https://brockleyjack.co.uk/jackstudio-entry/a-christmas-carol-js/', 'We Are Lewisham', 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/events/achristmascarol/', '2026-11-14T11:48:40.907Z', 0.75, 'a christmas carol|the jack studio theatre|2026-12-08'),
