('fb4423aa-4f49-4318-a7b9-2105693ffac5', 'Freudian Research Seminar – Psychoanalysis in the Digital Era', 'talk'::event_type, 'All registrants will receive their link to join via ZOOM. Attendees will also receive access to the recording on the Monday after the event, available to watch back for 3 months. ________________________________________________________________________ Abstract: The COVID-19 pandemic caused a major shift in psychoanalytic practice, requiring analysts around the world to move quickly from in-person sessions to remote work using telephone and video platforms. While this transition allowed treatment to continue, it also challenged traditional ideas about the analytic setting, presence, and the con', '{}'::text[], array['film','digital']::text[], array['community','independent']::text[], 'https://www.freud.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/HP-12.jpg', '2026-12-10', null, '18:00:00', '19:30:00', 'Online', null, 'W3 9BD', 'Hampstead', 51.501385, -0.2849707, 'unknown'::price_type, null, null, null, 'Freud Museum', 'https://www.freud.org.uk/event/freudian-research-seminar-psychoanalysis-in-the-digital-era/', '2026-11-14T11:49:07.662Z', 0.7, 'freudian research seminar psychoanalysis in the digital era|online|2026-12-10'),
('3d8fb990-be95-4b3e-a877-8207e16081a1', 'Learn the fair isle knitting technique and make a Christmas bag or bauble', 'workshop'::event_type, 'This two-week course will introduce you to the Fair Isle knitting technique, giving you the skills to create colourful patterns using two or more colours of yarn. You will also learn how to knit in the round using long circular needles. Put your new skills into practice as you work towards making a festive Christmas bag or bauble, creating a lovely handmade decoration or a thoughtful gift for someone special. Dates: Thursday 10 and 17 December 6:30-9pm Cost: £41 (full fee), £21 (reduced fee)', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], array['community','christmas','hands-on','outdoor','independent']::text[], 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/media/cache/86/d7/86d76dc66330ab729a5e2fea041a75b9.jpg', '2026-12-10', '2026-12-17', '18:30:00', null, 'Granville Park Adult Education Centre', 'Granville Park Adult Education Centre, 100 Granville Park, SE13 7DU', 'SE13 7DU', 'Lewisham', 51.46543, -0.01021, 'unknown'::price_type, null, true, 'https://all.org.uk/courses/handknitting-and-crochet/#course-89757', 'We Are Lewisham', 'https://www.wearelewisham.com/events/learnthefairisleknittingtechniqueandmakeachristm/', '2026-11-14T11:48:40.907Z', 0.75, 'learn the fair isle knitting technique and make a christmas bag or bauble|granville park adult education centre|2026-12-10'),
